    "title": "When is next USA baseball game? Americans face Dominican Republic in WBC semis",
    "text": "March 13, 2026Updated March 14, 2026, 11:42 a.m. ETDeeperDiveBETADeeperDive is a GenAI Answer Engine built for trusted publishers. It delivers clear answers and real-time content based on what people are reading now — showcasing various stories from the usatodaydemo Network that highlight not just what happened, but why it matters. This is currently a BETA being quality assessed by human beings. Mistakes may occur. Please reference surfaced articles to validate AI summaryTeam USA dispatched Canada in the World Baseball Classic quarterfinals, earning itself a showdown with the Dominican Republic on Sunday, March 15 in Miami.Loaded with Major League Baseball stars, the DR mercy-ruled South Korea 10-0 in their quarterfinal and is 5-0 in this tournament, scoring 51 runs in the process. Fernando Tatis Jr. is 7-for-16 (.438) with 11 RBIs and Vladimir Guerrero Jr. is batting .500 in four appearances with eight RBIs.Reigning NL Cy Young winner Paul Skenes is expected to start the semifinal for Team USA coming off a dazzling performance in his WBC debut.Team USA has now reached the semifinals in four of the six editions of the WBC, finishing runner-up to Japan in 2023 – after winning the 2017 title. The 2026 championship game will be played on Tuesday, March 17 at loanDepot Park, with the USA-Dominican winner facing Japan, Venezuela, Italy or Puerto Rico.Here's what to know for Team USA in the semifinals:Buy WBC tickets in Houston and MiamI!When is next USA baseball game?Date: Sunday, March 15Time: 8 p.m. ETStadium: loanDepot Park in MiamiLive stream: Watch World Baseball Classic on FuboWho does USA baseball face next in WBC?The Americans will face the Dominican Republic in the semifinal at loanDepot Park.The Dominicans have won two of three meetings between the countries at the World Baseball Classic, most recently a victory in the 2017 tournament marked by Nelson Cruz's dramatic late homer against Andrew Miller.WBC bracket 2026QuarterfinalsDominican Republic 10, South Korea 0 (F/7) Friday in MiamiUnited States vs. Canada – Friday in HoustonPuerto Rico vs. Italy – Saturday in Houston (BUY TICKETS)Japan vs. Venezuela – Saturday in Miami (BUY TICKETS)SemifinalsDominican Republic vs. USA/Canada – Sunday in Miami (BUY TICKETS)Puerto Rico/Italy vs. Japan/Venezuela – Monday in Miami (BUY TICKETS)WBC championship gameSemifinal winners – Tuesday, March 17 in Miami (BUY TICKETS)Our team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
